const rawContentHtml = "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Cloud, Cecil, Tidus, one left before we turn our attention to the four.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Rebel\">The Rebel</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Rebel\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_15?action=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Rebel\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<hr />\n<p>PLAYABLE CHARACTER - <b><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Firion_(Dissidia_PSP)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Firion (Dissidia PSP)\">Firion</a></b>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7d/Dissidia_Firion.png/revision/latest?cb=20201231210408\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dissidia Firion\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7d/Dissidia_Firion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20201231210408\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"290\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Dissidia Firion.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissidia_Firion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Firion is just barely a step up from the Warrior of Light and Onion Knight, but in such is more a step down. Unlike them he <i>did</i> exist in his original game, but that also carries the handicap that they have less flexibility with who he is, since the other two are pretty much original characters. And they did alright, Firion is a naive dreamer who just wants to end the war, and realizes that in comparison to his comrades, his goals are much simpler, but he'll come to realize that his dream isn't his alone.\n</p><p>Firion is a ground-focused character with a lousy pool of air moves, he has his spells but they aren't his niche, and he has Weaponsmaster, but Firion wants to be on the ground. So to make that a viable option, he's an anti-air fighter, he snags opponents out of the air and brings them down to him. His other gimmick is when using his three core ground Bravery attacks, he can do one of three follow-ups. Press forward and Circle to knock the opponent into the air and begin a chase, neutral Circle to slam them far away with a punch to wall rush them, or back and Circle to use a lance combo that slams them to the ground. He can also chain three aerial spells together, changing up which he uses with the same controller input. Combined with a decent pool of mid-ranged attacks and Firion is a fairly versatile mid-range fighter and has a lot of power, especially once he gets his HP links. \nHowever, as opposed to most other characters thus far, you really want to keep him on the ground. This means arenas like Planet's Core and Ultimecia's Castle are his worst nightmare.\n</p><p>Firion starts off with Rope Knife, a mid-ranged knife toss that drags the opponent closer, and Reel Axe, which is slow to execute but throws a guard-crushing axe a fair distance. His aerial spells are Frost and Bolt, Frost fires a blast of ice that begins a Chase, while Bolt creates lightning around the opponent to wall rush them into the ground. Three chained Thunders are usually enough to catch a dodging opponent on the third cast, if you chain them quickly, and even though he doesn't know Flame yet he can still throw out Fire spells as a second or third spell chained onto Frost or Bolt. His HP attack is Straightarrow, a fast but pretty easy to dodge arrow shot, hold the Square button to delay the firing and he'll turn to aim at opponents.\n</p><p>Firion is overall a pretty good character, but he won't reach his full potential until much later when he gets his other three HP attacks and learns his HP links, at which point he's a beast you don't want to get anywhere near on the ground or in the air.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>As we open, Firion reflects on his wild rose, which you may remember he doesn't have anymore since it was stolen by Sephiroth during Cloud's story. Tidus asks him about his life goal, but Firion doesn't have one really, he just wants to end the war.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imitation Liegeman\"><img alt=\"Imitation Liegeman\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"2000 gil\"><img alt=\"2000 gil\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Booster Accessory multiplier x5\"><img alt=\"Booster Accessory multiplier x5\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"False Hero\"><img alt=\"False Hero\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imitation Liegeman\"><img alt=\"Imitation Liegeman\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/40/Dissicon_ff10_tid1.png/revision/latest?cb=20101120015613\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Assist Character\"><img alt=\"Assist Character\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dissicon ff10 tid1.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissicon_ff10_tid1.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/40/Dissicon_ff10_tid1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/36?cb=20101120015613\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fleeting Flash\"><img alt=\"Fleeting Flash\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"2000 gil\"><img alt=\"2000 gil\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Jump Chain at C3 to get all four enemies, taking advantage of the Booster x5 emblem in the process. The bonus line as always is 2, and the KP Chance is a 90 second win. As a blanket note for Firion, he has a hard time generation EX Force. Rope Knife and a forward follow-up with the arrow shot generates the most, use that when trying to fill the EX Gauge.\n</p><p>First is an Imitation Liegeman, Firion's manikin, he's got Rope Knife and Straightarrow. Next comes a Fleeting Flash with Launch, Smite and Aerora. Now comes the Hard enemy, packing the accessory gimmick for Firion's story, and it's the most dangerous one yet. They come into battle with an Arcane Resin for a full EX Gauge - already bad, now it goes to worse - and they're got a Muscle Belt, an Earring, and 7 EX Mode boosters. That's a pretty significant damage buff, along with the EX Mode benefits of the boosted critical hit rate and Regen. An Assist attack will knock them out of EX Mode and give you the stage bravery pool, but by the time you've charged up your Assist their EX Mode is probably done, and later in the story you have no Assist at all. Be wary if these guys. Anyway, this one has Rope Knife, Reel Axe and Straightarrow. The last enemy is a False Hero with Rising Buckler.\n</p><p>With the opposition down, the two chests both have 2000 gil.\n</p><p>An interlude skips us ahead a bit to when the two split up, so now Firion is alone on the world map. Immediately turn around, there's a chest in plain sight to the right on the outcropping of land with 1000 gil. There's also the moogle of course, grab a few Multichains if you like, Firion's story is big on Multichains to get all enemies. Now move forward to Crescent Lake, the orbs of the dead lie along the path. There's a Delusory Warlock, use Rope Knife's range to your advantage when engaging enemies on the world map since most other foes use melee attacks. In battle it has Nightglow, watch out for that. On the island is a Rosetta Stone and on the ground nearby are two Ephemeral Phantoms, the first is fond of Jecht's Blade and the second prefers Triumphant Grasp. And in the ruins on the hill you fought them to get to? KP Gambler GET! Just the gateway now.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ae/DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204000919\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fallacious Wanderer\"><img alt=\"Fallacious Wanderer\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Strange Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ae/DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/17?cb=20110204000919\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Yaschas Massif Gravel\"><img alt=\"Yaschas Massif Gravel\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ephemeral Phantom\"><img alt=\"Ephemeral Phantom\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Magic Critical Rate Up\"><img alt=\"Magic Critical Rate Up\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ephemeral Summoner\"><img alt=\"Ephemeral Summoner\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Physical Critical Rate Up\"><img alt=\"Physical Critical Rate Up\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imaginary Soldier\"><img alt=\"Imaginary Soldier\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/86/DFF_Chaos_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235702\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Jecht\"><img alt=\"Jecht\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chaos Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chaos_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/86/DFF_Chaos_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/36?cb=20110203235702\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Multichain at C1 or C3, save that KP Gambler for a 5-enemy gateway. It's EX Gauge charging time, they're already throwing a boss at us. Remember, Rope Knife and forward follow-up generates the most EX Force. The KP Chance is a 60 second Break and the bonus line is 6.\n</p><p>First up, a humble Imaginary Soldier with Fire, Sonic Break, Slashing Blow and Cross-Slash, not a moveset for the typical Normal enemy eh? Now comes an Ephemeral Phantom with Jecht Rush, midair Jecht Block, Triumphant Grasp, those EX Mode accessories, and an unknown summon. Next, an Ephemeral Summoner with the EX Mode accessories, and she has Meteor Strike and Heavenly Strike. She has a summon too but oddly these guys never use their summons. I assume that like the accessories they all have the same one, maybe two, so if a later one calls its summon I'll bring it up and you keep in mind most probably use it even if I don't see it. The last foe is a Fallacious Wanderer who spams Ragnarok Blade, it uses Pupu and has a Hyper Ring with 3 No Damage boosters, but Ragnarok Blade does no Bravery damage so it's just a waste of accessories.\n</p><p>Firion gets Lance Combo at Level 4, it's the final of the three core Bravery attacks he has, a lance sweep around him that sucks in the opponent. It only executes marginally faster than Rope Knife but hits all around him. Also note with all three, the backwards follow up, the overhead lance attack, can be done even if the attack misses, the other two are only usable on a hit.\n</p><p>The chest has Yaschas Massif Gravel before you go to the end. Firion runs into Jecht, still ticked that the Emperor stepped in between him and Tidus and looking for an outlet to vent. Firion is just in the wrong place at the wrong time.\n</p>\n<table style=\"width: 275px; D012 article-table; text-align: center; color:black; float:right\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"font-size: larger; background:#1E90FF\" colspan=\"6\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Boss</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#1E90FF\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"6\"><b><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Jecht_(Dissidia_PSP)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Jecht (Dissidia PSP)\">Jecht</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#dddddd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"6\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/4b/JechtDissidiaModel.png/revision/latest?cb=20110706093029\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"JechtDissidiaModel\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"87\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"JechtDissidiaModel.png\" data-image-key=\"JechtDissidiaModel.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/4b/JechtDissidiaModel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/87?cb=20110706093029\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#1E90FF\">\n<td width=\"33%\" colspan=\"2\"><b>HP</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" colspan=\"2\"><b>Level</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" colspan=\"2\"><b>Bravery</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#dddddd\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">2,738\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">21\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\">207\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#1E90FF\">\n<td colspan=\"6\"><b>Brave Attacks</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#dddddd\">\n<td colspan=\"6\">Jecht Rush, Jecht Stream, Jecht Block\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#1E90FF\">\n<td colspan=\"6\"><b>HP Attacks</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#dddddd\">\n<td colspan=\"6\">Jecht Beam, Jecht Blade\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#1E90FF\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"><b>Summon</b>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><b>Difficulty</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr bgcolor=\"#dddddd\">\n<td colspan=\"3\">Bahamut\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">1/5\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Jecht only has two boosters on his Muscle Belt, one each Near Opponent and Attacking Bravery. It's fine, he doesn't need his Bravery attacks. Look at his summon - Bahamut. \"Wait\" I hear you cry out in horror, \"the summon that gives him 99 Bravery every two seconds?\" Yup, that's the one. Jecht will eventually get enough Bravery to deal a one-hit knockout to Firion, hope you've gotten the hang of his attacks and how to avoid them...of course there's still Jecht Block, so you're very likely to get blocked on your Lance Combo or Rope Knife and then eat a 2000 point damage Jecht Beam in the balls.\n</p><p>Not much to say on this fight, you just finished taking out Jecht, this one just has lower stats but a much deadlier summon. Fortunately, if you have Cactuar, there's a simple way to stop Bahamut in his tracks. Firion's punch follow-up does a lot of damage. Nail Jecht with a Rope Knife or Reel Axe and them punch him, this should do enough Bravery damage that he'll call Bahamut. Now snag him again and as you do the follow-up, summon Cactuar. The faithful little cactoid will sap Jecht's Bravery to 0, just in time for you to Break him, and Bahamut's boosts suddenly don't mean a thing since the boosts don't work while Broken. Overall if you do this, Jecht is pretty easy, wall rush him after that, then let him recovery his Bravery and use an EX Burst to blast him. Just watch for Jecht Block, he usually isn't smart enough to do it but he can use it to deflect even your Reel Axe and Straightarrow\n</p><p>Let's talk about Firion's EX Mode while we're here. It's pretty lame, sadly. Firion gets Blood Weapons, so every time he deals HP damage, he heals the same amount of damage. Useless unless you're about to die, and that won't happen if you play smart. His EX Burst is one of my favorites for badassery. Fervid Blazer is a sequence of five commands, three directional buttons and two of the command buttons, and you have to press them in the shown order within a time limit for Firion to bombard the opponent with all his weapons and magic, finishing by firing his arsenal at them with his bow. And he still heals all the damage he does with it.\n</p><p>After the fight, Jecht takes off, deciding to have a \"chat\" with the Emperor about butting in, and you know already how it goes. Tidus rejoins him a second after Jecht leaves, and the two comrades forge ahead together again.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"A_Dream_of_Roses\">A Dream of Roses</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: A Dream of Roses\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_15?action=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: A Dream of Roses\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A small area of the world map to explore now. Go right through the grass to find a Cure skill, then head into the blue gateway.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"><img alt=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\